{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-q2-se-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Luxe Q2 SE Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Vaporesso LUXE Q2 SE Pod System, offering a 1000mAh battery, draw-activated firing, and LUXE Q pods with integrated coils to deliver delicious flavor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-q-replacement-pods\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe Q Replacement Pods\"\u003eVaporesso LUXE Q Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the LUXE Q2 SE is vibrant, featuring pastel colors or colorful designs. Perfect for new vapers or seasoned veterans, the Luxe Q2 SE is simple to use, functioning off a draw-activated firing system. Free of any buttons or screens on the chassis, the LUXE Q2 SE Kit conserves the power in the 1000mAh battery for outputting delicious flavor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts. Compatible with the LUXE Q Pods, the Luxe Q2 SE Pod System comes natively with a 0.8ohm coil integrated into the 3mL refillable pod.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVaporesso LUXE Q2 SE Kit Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 96.7mm by 27.4mm by 17.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Zinc-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: LUXE Q\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Side Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Integrated Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 LUXE Q2 SE Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm LUXE Q Mesh Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Lanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41876294959159,"sku":"V Luxe Q2 SE Pod System","price":4100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_luxe_q2_se_pod_system_-_fashion_black.webp?v=1757895368","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-q2-se-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




